# K-tile Rust project — generated artifacts and local-only files

# --- Rust / Cargo ---
# Build output (rigenerabile via `cargo build`)
/target/
# Backup del compilatore/IDE Rust
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
# Cargo.lock: NON ignorato di proposito.
# `ktile` sarà un binario applicativo -> il lock va committato per build riproducibili.
# (Se in futuro diventa workspace lib+bin, rivalutare.)

# --- OS / Linux ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
.nfs*
.Trash-*

# --- Editor / IDE ---
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json.default
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
*~
\#*\#
.\#*

# --- Diagnostics (keep local X11 logs out of version control) ---
*.log
xev.log
*.pcap
/tmp/

# --- Build and packaging artifacts ---
*.deb
*.rpm
*.tar.gz
dist/

# --- Env / secrets (mai committare) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
